                    "message": "Adding a default path as const string:\n\n```suggestion\n    std::optional<std::filesystem::path> boardPath;\n    static constexpr const char* defaultBoardPath =\n    \"/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/PLDM_Device\";\n```"
