                        "username": "mmetha"
                    },
                    "message": "Simplifing the boardPath assignment here.\n\n```suggestion\n    boardPath = (inventoryPath) ? getBoardPath(*dbusHandler, *inventoryPath).value_or(defaultBoardPath) : defaultBoardPath;\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/firmware_inventory_manager.cpp",
